The BOHOL vape vending machine is a configurable B2B platform for markets and sites where automated sale or controlled dispensing is legally permitted. Its multi-row cabinet can be planned around real product packages, payment hardware, purchase controls, branding and operator workflows. The supplied infographics are design concepts rather than customer-deployment evidence; dimensions, capacity, payment, software and compliance scope must be confirmed in the final order specification.

Before requesting a quotation, buyers should send the destination country, proposed site, legal review, product samples, required access-control process, payment provider, branding files, quantity and acceptance criteria. BOHOL will not treat a card reader, keypad or promotional image as proof that a project is legally compliant.
